{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A post-apocalyptic open-world adventure set among the ruins of a world destroyed by artificial intelligence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the rise \u2014 came the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/6100a6cd35745a257e14efb9f0f54756.avif?t=1764069178\" width=1560 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity\u2019s greatest creation turned against its makers, tearing civilization apart and leaving only scattered islands adrift in the endless sea. Centuries later, the last survivors rebuild what remains of the world \u2014 plank by plank, stone by stone, secret by secret. You are one of them \u2014 a stranger washed ashore with no memory, no past, and one burning question: <i>What happened here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/ba1d99dc0b5713ca3f72ec15c41d8b64.avif?t=1764069178\" width=1194 height=678 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Landoff</strong>, you don\u2019t just survive \u2014 you <strong>live</strong>.<br>Sail between islands on your boat <i>without a map</i>, guided only by beacons, NPC clues, and dialogues. Trade goods and contraband, fight bandits, earn influence across the archipelago, uncover relics of the fallen world, and climb the fragile social ladder of this broken civilization. Every island hides its own story, dangers, and forgotten technologies \u2014 remnants of the AI that nearly destroyed humanity in its attempt to save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft. Trade. Explore. Steal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship, forge alliances, and unveil the truth buried beneath layers of rust and coral. Will you become a wealthy merchant, a ruthless pirate, or a legend whispered across the seas? Force cities to work for you, sell your goods, hang your banners on billboards, and show your ambition to the entire archipelago!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/06ba7adbbbd529bcf845751791b65fc1.avif?t=1764069178\" width=1098 height=610 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World with Complete Freedom</strong> \u2013 Explore a vast archipelago shaped by storms, time, and forgotten machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading and Economy</strong> \u2013 Buy low, sell high, and build your fortune \u2014 or raid, explore, and sell your loot! Develop your own production and push your goods onto megacity shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong> \u2013 Every island holds mysteries, secrets, and lost memories of who we were \u2014 and what we became.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Survival</strong> \u2013 Engage in tense battles with bandits, creatures, and remnants of rogue AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Atmosphere and Realistic Boats</strong> \u2013 Fight the waves and sail with realistic physics, balancing your cargo and survival at sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Storyline and Quests</strong> \u2013 Piece together the truth about the cataclysm and your lost past, one clue at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is not just survival.<br>This is <strong>Landoff</strong> \u2014 a hauntingly beautiful, dangerous world where every wave hides a secret, and every decision shapes your fate.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951670?t=1764069178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951670?t=1764069178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/0bbba6bdb8f87baba5decc4a2de7794663e23208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764069178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/0bbba6bdb8f87baba5decc4a2de7794663e23208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764069178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of violence, blood, and scenes involving alcohol consumption.\r\nPlayer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A post-apocalyptic open-world adventure set among the ruins of a world destroyed by artificial intelligence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the rise \u2014 came the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/6100a6cd35745a257e14efb9f0f54756.avif?t=1764069178\" width=1560 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity\u2019s greatest creation turned against its makers, tearing civilization apart and leaving only scattered islands adrift in the endless sea. Centuries later, the last survivors rebuild what remains of the world \u2014 plank by plank, stone by stone, secret by secret. You are one of them \u2014 a stranger washed ashore with no memory, no past, and one burning question: <i>What happened here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/ba1d99dc0b5713ca3f72ec15c41d8b64.avif?t=176406