d Survival</strong> \u2013 Engage in tense battles with bandits, creatures, and remnants of rogue AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Atmosphere and Realistic Boats</strong> \u2013 Fight the waves and sail with realistic physics, balancing your cargo and survival at sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Storyline and Quests</strong> \u2013 Piece together the truth about the cataclysm and your lost past, one clue at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is not just survival.<br>This is <strong>Landoff</strong> \u2014 a hauntingly beautiful, dangerous world where every wave hides a secret, and every decision shapes your fate.</i></p>","developers":["HalfBread Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/4d084726cebb650a96c6be94d394fc46239db127/header.jpg?t=1764069178","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951670/822944370/65ce438197a05c15d95553ce13a7ead034a6898e/1762756602/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762758546","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951670/822944370/65ce438197a05c15d95553ce13a7ead034a6898e/1762756602/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762758546","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951670/822944370/65ce438197a05c15d95553ce13a7ead034a6898e/1762756602/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762758546","id":257229002,"name":"Landoff - trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s